3. Sharp PlasmaCluster Ion Air Purifier FPK50UW - Using a combination of a three-stage filter system and ion technology, this device can effectively eliminate 99.97% of particles as small as 0.3 microns from the air in medium-sized rooms measuring up to 1,253 square feet. Additionally, it contains carbon for controlling odors and meets both Energy Star and AHAM standards.

