5. IQAir GC MultiGas - As one of the most advanced air purifiers available, this model employs medical-grade filtration for eliminating allergens and volatile organic compounds (VOCs). Suitable for individuals who require high efficiency in removing gases and odors, especially in larger spaces.</s>

